      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... what if it's not something a doctor can \"fix\"? what if this is just how it ends? i look in the mirror and i see someone i recognize, but i know that person is dying. i don't want to wait until i'm a burden to my family, or until i can't even recognize them. there's something dignified about choosing your own exit before you lose the ability to even understand why you're doing it. doesn't that make sense?",
